<title>USA: Base Ten retains Cowen &amp; Co as advisor.</title>
<headline>Base Ten retains Cowen &amp; Co as advisor.</headline>
<dateline>TRENTON, N.J. 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Base Ten Systems Inc said Monday it retained Cowen &amp; Co as its financial advisor.</p>
<p>Base Ten said Cowen &amp; Co will assist it with the financial and investment banking related aspects of its on-going business plan.</p>
<p>&quot;We are very pleased to be associated with as prestigious a firm as Cowen and look forward to a mutually rewarding relationship,&quot; said Base Ten chief executive Mike Kranzler.</p>
</text>
